(5259135, 765183, 327, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and I like your desaturation here. I would only point out that the bottle is tilted a bit and somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Excellent idea and I like your desaturation here. I would only point out that the bottle is tilted a bit and somewhat distracting.', '2009-02-16 14:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
