(5259300, 765472, 64446, '<td valign="top">Exellent image. Great use of desaturation. The paper seems to jump out the image. Too bad the message is not English - you could have put in the title, so I (and many others, I bet) could understand and have a better appreciation for the image as a whole.</td>', 'Exellent image. Great use of desaturation. The paper seems to jump out the image. Too bad the message is not English - you could have put in the title, so I (and many others, I bet) could understand and have a better appreciation for the image as a whole.', '2009-02-16 17:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259308, 765124, 96751, '<td valign="top">What a stunning image.  Seriously great light and depth, wonderful colors and textures.  The issue for me is that the note is written on paper that does not look like a post-it.  I''m not saying it isn''t, but it doesn''t look like it.  Slight ding for that.</td>', 'What a stunning image.  Seriously great light and depth, wonderful colors and textures.  The issue for me is that the note is written on paper that does not look like a post-it.  I''m not saying it isn''t, but it doesn''t look like it.  Slight ding for that.', '2009-02-16 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259311, 765486, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great symmetry, sharpness, colors, shapes.</td>', 'Great symmetry, sharpness, colors, shapes.', '2009-02-16 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259312, 765644, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the backlighting and colors.  I guess I''ve just seen too many of these though.</td>', 'Love the backlighting and colors.  I guess I''ve just seen too many of these though.', '2009-02-16 17:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259316, 765365, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great product shot.  Great thought and design went into the layout.  Just a tad flat dimension-wise for me.  Would have liked some sort of depth, even a vague shadow.</td>', 'Great product shot.  Great thought and design went into the layout.  Just a tad flat dimension-wise for me.  Would have liked some sort of depth, even a vague shadow.', '2009-02-16 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259318, 765389, 64446, '<td valign="top">The post-it artwork is amazing! I like the composition, as portraiting the artist and his work.</td>', 'The post-it artwork is amazing! I like the composition, as portraiting the artist and his work.', '2009-02-16 17:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259320, 765622, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is A LOT of work.  Excellent idea and execution.  Want to read about the set-up.</td>', 'Wow.  This is A LOT of work.  Excellent idea and execution.  Want to read about the set-up.', '2009-02-16 17:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259324, 764455, 96751, '<td valign="top">You have a LOT of time on your hands.... :-)  Incredible amount of work.  Love the idea and the details.  There''s a bit too much of a blue cast on the entire shot.  I think this would have worked better if the "flowers" didn''t also have a blue cast.</td>', 'You have a LOT of time on your hands.... :-)  Incredible amount of work.  Love the idea and the details.  There''s a bit too much of a blue cast on the entire shot.  I think this would have worked better if the "flowers" didn''t also have a blue cast.', '2009-02-16 17:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259325, 765243, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition! And this guys is irresistable...</td>', 'Very clever composition! And this guys is irresistable...', '2009-02-16 17:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259331, 765606, 96751, '<td valign="top">This gets the Awwwww factor vote.  Very sweet.  Love the brown tones of the pooch reflected on the floor.  I know it must have been tough to get the shot, but I wish the top line wasn''t coming out of his ear...</td>', 'This gets the Awwwww factor vote.  Very sweet.  Love the brown tones of the pooch reflected on the floor.  I know it must have been tough to get the shot, but I wish the top line wasn''t coming out of his ear...', '2009-02-16 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259332, 765609, 96751, '<td valign="top">Mine used to be a Smith Corona...  Great reto/modern combo.  Love this shot.</td>', 'Mine used to be a Smith Corona...  Great reto/modern combo.  Love this shot.', '2009-02-16 17:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5259335, 765167, 96751, '<td valign="top">Yummmmmmmm!  What a gorgeous treat.  Nice shapes and colors, but just the tiniest bit of contrast might have helped with depth.</td>', 'Yummmmmmmm!  What a gorgeous treat.  Nice shapes and colors, but just the tiniest bit of contrast might have helped with depth.', '2009-02-16 17:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
