(5260197, 765249, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve gone through the photos about 5 times now before voting. I liked this very much the first time around. And though I liked a large number the first time, a number of the bright flashy ones have gone down in my estimation--this one just really pulls at me. I would have given it an 8 first time through--but I''m upping it to a 10 because of the fact that I''m more and more intrigued each time. Well done!</td>', 'I''ve gone through the photos about 5 times now before voting. I liked this very much the first time around. And though I liked a large number the first time, a number of the bright flashy ones have gone down in my estimation--this one just really pulls at me. I would have given it an 8 first time through--but I''m upping it to a 10 because of the fact that I''m more and more intrigued each time. Well done!', '2009-02-17 09:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
