(5260414, 765361, 102024, '<td valign="top">I understand that you wanted to go for the "candle light only" sort of scene, but I think that this image is just too yellow.  Perhaps a bit of very subtle ambient light could have brightened it up a bit?</td>', 'I understand that you wanted to go for the "candle light only" sort of scene, but I think that this image is just too yellow.  Perhaps a bit of very subtle ambient light could have brightened it up a bit?', '2009-02-17 11:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260416, 765249, 102024, '<td valign="top">A little too much post-processing, in my opinion.  Not sure if the flat colors really help this image out too well as it is.</td>', 'A little too much post-processing, in my opinion.  Not sure if the flat colors really help this image out too well as it is.', '2009-02-17 11:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260418, 765089, 102024, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well executed.  But the direct flash is very distracting off the girls leg and the subsequent shadow it produces.</td>', 'Good idea and well executed.  But the direct flash is very distracting off the girls leg and the subsequent shadow it produces.', '2009-02-17 11:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260419, 765622, 102024, '<td valign="top">A tad over processed if you ask me, but I like the idea and I like the execution.  The lines from what I''m assuming is an inkjet printer are a bit distracting.</td>', 'A tad over processed if you ask me, but I like the idea and I like the execution.  The lines from what I''m assuming is an inkjet printer are a bit distracting.', '2009-02-17 11:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260421, 765063, 102024, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the pattern on the surface.  The DOF is perfect and image is well composed.  The interesting geometry here reminds me very much of those early computer generated graphics that were "too perfect," if you know what I''m talking about...</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the pattern on the surface.  The DOF is perfect and image is well composed.  The interesting geometry here reminds me very much of those early computer generated graphics that were "too perfect," if you know what I''m talking about...', '2009-02-17 11:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260424, 765423, 102024, '<td valign="top">A little oversaturated, if you ask me.</td>', 'A little oversaturated, if you ask me.', '2009-02-17 11:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260426, 765257, 102024, '<td valign="top">Intense.  Took me a second to get it, actually.  I like the idea, but I think that the composition could be stronger.  Everything is trapped tight in the frame of the image, yet the book is breaking the border and throwing it off balance for me.</td>', 'Intense.  Took me a second to get it, actually.  I like the idea, but I think that the composition could be stronger.  Everything is trapped tight in the frame of the image, yet the book is breaking the border and throwing it off balance for me.', '2009-02-17 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260427, 765602, 102024, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I see fire.  This image looks very organic to me.  The subtleties in the lines remind me of a flower or a leaf.</td>', 'Not sure if I see fire.  This image looks very organic to me.  The subtleties in the lines remind me of a flower or a leaf.', '2009-02-17 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260428, 764498, 102024, '<td valign="top">Haha, nice.  His tie is excellent.</td>', 'Haha, nice.  His tie is excellent.', '2009-02-17 12:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260431, 765620, 37444, '<td valign="top">very colorful, but the pink needs to be in focus as well 7</td>', 'very colorful, but the pink needs to be in focus as well 7', '2009-02-17 12:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260432, 765549, 102024, '<td valign="top">Pretty crazy lamp shade.  Looks like you definitely spent some time making this.  Good job, but the lighting is a bit weak in my opinion.</td>', 'Pretty crazy lamp shade.  Looks like you definitely spent some time making this.  Good job, but the lighting is a bit weak in my opinion.', '2009-02-17 12:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5260433, 765475, 102024, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I think more fire would have worked better.  Of course I understand that more fire would probably not be a good idea, but I''m just saying... and the lighting here is way too direct.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I think more fire would have worked better.  Of course I understand that more fire would probably not be a good idea, but I''m just saying... and the lighting here is way too direct.', '2009-02-17 12:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
