(5260445, 764786, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I''m sure this looked better at a higher resolution.  The door is really throwing me off of the composition, though.  The strong one-point perspective lines of the door contrast with the more linear aspects of the focal point and throw me off balance.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I''m sure this looked better at a higher resolution.  The door is really throwing me off of the composition, though.  The strong one-point perspective lines of the door contrast with the more linear aspects of the focal point and throw me off balance.', '2009-02-17 12:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
