(5266924, 765472, 51747, '<td valign="top">I think this is an interesting image. I don''t feel that the post-it note has major impact in this picture, mostly because the majority of viewers can''t understand the text on the note. I hope this doesn''t sound discriminatory, but many here cannot understand the message parlayed on the paper. That being said, The selective de-sat and the composition are very good!</td>', 'I think this is an interesting image. I don''t feel that the post-it note has major impact in this picture, mostly because the majority of viewers can''t understand the text on the note. I hope this doesn''t sound discriminatory, but many here cannot understand the message parlayed on the paper. That being said, The selective de-sat and the composition are very good!', '2009-02-20 21:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
