(5269241, 765029, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool eyeball. I may have one somewhere. If I can find it, I need to put it in my prop box. At a quick glance, the textured surface that this is on appears to be noise grain.</td>', 'Cool eyeball. I may have one somewhere. If I can find it, I need to put it in my prop box. At a quick glance, the textured surface that this is on appears to be noise grain.', '2009-02-22 20:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269244, 765609, 83313, '<td valign="top">The sticky side must jam on the roller. Nice perspective, and I like the contrast of the old fashioned typewriter with the colorful modern stickynotes. The whole thing works for me. (Except for the asymmetric border) A fave and a high vote.</td>', 'The sticky side must jam on the roller. Nice perspective, and I like the contrast of the old fashioned typewriter with the colorful modern stickynotes. The whole thing works for me. (Except for the asymmetric border) A fave and a high vote.', '2009-02-22 20:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269249, 765458, 83313, '<td valign="top">This strikes me as an <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=94403" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">LPatrick</a> entry. Cool looking abstract. Nice shading of the gray tones. That''s tough to do with JPEG. I have a lot of problems with banding on such things.</td>', 'This strikes me as an  LPatrick entry. Cool looking abstract. Nice shading of the gray tones. That''s tough to do with JPEG. I have a lot of problems with banding on such things.', '2009-02-22 20:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269251, 765249, 83313, '<td valign="top">Has an antique look to it. I like the way you managed to show a lot of texture on these.</td>', 'Has an antique look to it. I like the way you managed to show a lot of texture on these.', '2009-02-22 20:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269255, 765044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting. My nephew does origami. If I had thought of it, I may have had him do something like this for me, but I was completely uninspired for this challenge, and skipped entering this one.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting. My nephew does origami. If I had thought of it, I may have had him do something like this for me, but I was completely uninspired for this challenge, and skipped entering this one.', '2009-02-22 20:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269261, 765364, 83313, '<td valign="top">The mystery would be...? Why this person killed themselves. I think. Looking forward to reading your notes on this.<br/> <br/>Grim and effective. I''m going to guess this to be an entry from [user]Nighttrain[/user]. The theme is similar and it looks like possibly the same person as in <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=747184" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">A Shocking End</a>.</td>', 'The mystery would be...? Why this person killed themselves. I think. Looking forward to reading your notes on this. Grim and effective. I''m going to guess this to be an entry from [user]Nighttrain[/user]. The theme is similar and it looks like possibly the same person as in A Shocking End.', '2009-02-22 20:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269263, 765125, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is the dawning of the age of Aquarius!!! <br/> <br/>Sorry, not only can''t I carry a tune in bucket, but I can''t carry one in a comment box either. At any rate, ''60''s flashback was my reaction to this, hence my first line.</td>', 'This is the dawning of the age of Aquarius!!!  Sorry, not only can''t I carry a tune in bucket, but I can''t carry one in a comment box either. At any rate, ''60''s flashback was my reaction to this, hence my first line.', '2009-02-22 20:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269265, 765562, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s affordable. Do you wash it or erase it? ...and what''s with the lollipop?</td>', 'Well, it''s affordable. Do you wash it or erase it? ...and what''s with the lollipop?', '2009-02-22 20:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269266, 765299, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t see the heart until after reading the title. Kind of reminds me of those images they use to test for color blindness.</td>', 'Didn''t see the heart until after reading the title. Kind of reminds me of those images they use to test for color blindness.', '2009-02-22 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269268, 765362, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute ''lil fella. (I think frogs are in danger of becoming a DPC cliche!)</td>', 'Cute ''lil fella. (I think frogs are in danger of becoming a DPC cliche!)', '2009-02-22 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269273, 765249, 100106, '<td valign="top">Really like this image. In a challenge where everything is boasting with color, you took the opposite route. I like your PP and the textures you achieved. Plus how the edges are lighter and give impact. Composition and crop also add to the image. It''s hard to do post-it notes desat like this but IMO, you did a wonderful job. 8</td>', 'Really like this image. In a challenge where everything is boasting with color, you took the opposite route. I like your PP and the textures you achieved. Plus how the edges are lighter and give impact. Composition and crop also add to the image. It''s hard to do post-it notes desat like this but IMO, you did a wonderful job. 8', '2009-02-22 20:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269280, 765599, 100106, '<td valign="top">Nice border and interesting angle. Wasn''t sure if the angle worked for me but after looking at it a bit, it does. Flower petals aren''t the same all the way around, and why should these be (the petals). The lighting, background and border are great. 8 = good composition, techs and meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Nice border and interesting angle. Wasn''t sure if the angle worked for me but after looking at it a bit, it does. Flower petals aren''t the same all the way around, and why should these be (the petals). The lighting, background and border are great. 8 = good composition, techs and meeting the challenge.', '2009-02-22 20:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269281, 765642, 100106, '<td valign="top">Great textures, reflection, background and nice choice for border color. Good placment of your subject as well.</td>', 'Great textures, reflection, background and nice choice for border color. Good placment of your subject as well.', '2009-02-22 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269283, 765620, 100106, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Really like the lines inside the petals. Adds a lot for me to the photo. Your lighting is great and enjoy the white background.</td>', 'Nicely done! Really like the lines inside the petals. Adds a lot for me to the photo. Your lighting is great and enjoy the white background.', '2009-02-22 20:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269285, 765398, 100106, '<td valign="top">Very creative IMO. The use of reflections and shadows here are great. Not sure what was used as a background, but the texture in it, seems to pull my eye into the shadows. A flat BG might have made those shadows smooth which for me, wouldn''t have pulled my eye so much. Again, just a thought. 7 for creativity alone with the shapes, shadows and reflections.</td>', 'Very creative IMO. The use of reflections and shadows here are great. Not sure what was used as a background, but the texture in it, seems to pull my eye into the shadows. A flat BG might have made those shadows smooth which for me, wouldn''t have pulled my eye so much. Again, just a thought. 7 for creativity alone with the shapes, shadows and reflections.', '2009-02-22 20:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269287, 765258, 100106, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-02-22 20:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269294, 765482, 100106, '<td valign="top">Creative, funny and true. This is going to sound stupid, but, my fav part of this image are how well the thought clouds were drawn. They look good. =)Just as a suggestion, might have switched the colors in the picture. Have the post-it notes with all the colors and had your model wear something boring. I find her shirt pulls my focus, and just curious if the colors were reversed, if it would have made the notes pop more. Again, just my .02</td>', 'Creative, funny and true. This is going to sound stupid, but, my fav part of this image are how well the thought clouds were drawn. They look good. =)Just as a suggestion, might have switched the colors in the picture. Have the post-it notes with all the colors and had your model wear something boring. I find her shirt pulls my focus, and just curious if the colors were reversed, if it would have made the notes pop more. Again, just my .02', '2009-02-22 20:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269295, 765570, 94265, '<td valign="top">I reckon this could hit front page. Great idea, really original and nicely executed.</td>', 'I reckon this could hit front page. Great idea, really original and nicely executed.', '2009-02-22 20:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269299, 765633, 94265, '<td valign="top">I see this one has been validated, glad to know it''s legal (the post-its do look a little like they were photoshopped on) cos I think it''s awesome. Great tones, cool textures on the wood and glass too. Definitely one of my favourite images.</td>', 'I see this one has been validated, glad to know it''s legal (the post-its do look a little like they were photoshopped on) cos I think it''s awesome. Great tones, cool textures on the wood and glass too. Definitely one of my favourite images.', '2009-02-22 20:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5269305, 765399, 87751, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Very creative --- and a nice image to boot.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Very creative --- and a nice image to boot.', '2009-02-22 21:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
