(5271673, 765604, 25773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the duality. There seems to be either a strong color cast, or these post-it''s are purple. </i></td></tr></table> The post-it is purple/pink (should have chosen something else... but it was for love (the front side). I couldn''t get another mirror that would not do this ghosting.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I like the duality. There seems to be either a strong color cast, or these post-it''s are purple.  The post-it is purple/pink (should have chosen something else... but it was for love (the front side). I couldn''t get another mirror that would not do this ghosting.', '2009-02-24 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
